    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋirukitos a Daudi analoŋisat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikilyok ŋice toloto neni a Daudi apaki ŋina ayakar iŋes Sikilag, ŋina pa apedoritor akirimit aŋuna a Saul alokoku a Kis; arae ŋikilyok ŋul ŋulu kepotu sek ekiŋaren kiŋarakis Daudi alojie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakatar ikes ŋikaleŋeleŋe, ido ayenete nooi akigum ŋikaleŋeleŋe, kori adoiyanar ŋamoru ka adoe isitiyaete teten, kori kedyeny. Arae ikes ŋiyeneta a Saul ŋulu anateker a Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok ŋul ikes lu: Aieser ŋolo arae ekarikon kec ka Yoas ŋidwe a Semaa a ŋolo alo Gibea ŋulusapa; Yesiel ka Pelet ŋidwe ka Asimapes; Bereka, Yeu ŋolo alo Anasos, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isimaya ŋolo alo Gibeon ŋolo arae ekajion ŋolo etiron alokidiŋ ŋulutomoniuni; arae iŋes apolokinit ŋulutomoniuni; Yeremia, Yasiel, Yoanan, Yosabad ŋolo alo Gedera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elusai, Yerimos, Bealia, Semaria ka Sepatia ŋolo alo Arup; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elikana, Isia, Asarel, Yoeser ka Yasobeam ŋolo alo Kora; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoela ka Sebadia ŋidwe a Yeroam a ŋolo alo Gedor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋigadi ŋice toloto neni a Daudi apaki ŋina ayakar naloŋisat neni eboiyo iŋes anaturukan. Arae ikes ŋikajiok ŋulu atitinyok, ŋulu etemokino ajiore, ido apedorito akitiŋ ŋaupala ka ŋakwaaras. Atakanete ikes aloreetin esibit ŋiŋatunyo, ido apiraka ekote ŋagetei ŋuna eya lokamukumukui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Eser iŋes apolokinit ikes, Obadia iŋes ŋolo a ŋiarei ka Eliab iŋes ŋolo a ŋiuni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misimana iŋes ŋolo a ŋiomwon, Yeremia iŋes ŋolo a ŋikan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atai iŋes ŋolo a ŋikanikapei, Eliel iŋes ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoanan iŋes ŋolo a ŋikanikauni, Elisabad iŋes ŋolo a ŋikanikaomwon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia iŋes ŋolo a ŋitomon, ido Macibanai iŋes ŋolo a ŋitomon ka epei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Ŋigadi ŋul ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya; ajore kec ŋina adit arae ŋituŋa amiat, ŋina apolon nooi arae ŋituŋa aliput. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ikes apotu todokut ekekwalo aŋolol Yorodan elap ŋolo esyaunan, apaki ŋina elelebar epakitor alokipetotyo a daadaŋ. Apotu ikes kitijikis ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu eboiyete anakadipaalae a ŋuna alo Kide ka To.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu daŋ ŋituŋa a Benjamin ka ŋulu a Yuda ŋice potu neni a Daudi neni eboiyo anaturukan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolot Daudi kisiryam ikes tema, “Ani kiponito iyes neni kaŋ ke ekisil, akiŋarakin ayoŋ, ekejauni ayoŋ iyes emorikinos ka ayoŋ. Nai ani kiponito iyes arikor ayoŋ neni a ŋimoe kaŋ, tomam aronis etiyat ayoŋ, elipi ayoŋ Akuj ŋina atapapaa yok kiŋolik ŋun, ido itotubok iyes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai etau ka Akuj bu neni ka Amasai a ŋolo arae ekarikon a ŋikilyok a ŋulutomoniuni, ido abu tema, “Okoe Daudi, ikirae isua ŋulu kon! Okoe lokoku a Yese, ikiriit isua ka iyoŋ! Kiryama ka ekisil, kiryama ka ekisil, ekisil toyai neni a ŋulu iriitotor iyoŋ, anerae ikiŋarakinit iyoŋ Akuj kon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Manase ŋice toriwo neni a Daudi apaki ŋina alosyoto Daudi ka Ŋipilistin akitijiore Saul. (Nai abu Daudi ka ŋikajiok keŋ nyiŋarakis Ŋipilistin, anerae ani kedaut Ŋipilistin a kimima ŋakiro a Daudi, apotu kiritasi Daudi ka ŋirukitos keŋ nariet. Temasi, “Ikicakari iwon akiyar yok kikiruko ka iŋes, ido toriwo iŋes ka Saul.”) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani apaki ŋin elosi Daudi Sikilag, apotu ŋituŋa a Manase lu toriwo ka iŋes: Adina, Yosabad, Yediel, Mikael, Yosabad, Eliu ka Silesai, arae ikes ŋikarikok a ŋajorei a ŋuna aya ŋituŋa aliput alo Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes kiŋarakis Daudi akitijiore ŋajorei, anerae arae ikes daadaŋ ŋikajiok ŋulu atitiny ka arae ikes ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya a Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋinakoloŋit, aponeneete ŋituŋa neni a Daudi akirii ka akiŋarakin iŋes, akitodol ŋina abunio Daudi toryamunia ŋasigarya ŋuna alalak ka ŋuna etirok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋasigarya a Daudi alo Eburon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae lo ekimar a ŋasigarya a ŋuna ayakatar ŋiboro ŋulujiet, a ŋuna apotu toloto neni a Daudi alo Eburon, aŋuna ka akikamar apukan a Saul inakinae Daudi, lopite ŋolo kelimunitor Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alokabila a Yuda, ŋulu ayakatar ŋaupala ka ŋakwaaras itemokino aŋuna ke ejie, arae ŋalipyo ŋakanikapei ka ŋamiae a ŋakanikauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alokabila a Simeon, ŋulu ajiok ŋulu etemokino aŋuna ke ejie, arae ŋalipyo ŋakanikaarei ka amiat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alokabila a Lepi, arae ŋalipyo ŋaomwon ka ŋamiae ŋakanikapei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arukito ekarikon a ekal ka Aron ŋolo anyaritae Yeoiada ka ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋauni ka ŋamiae ŋakanikaarei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arukito esorokit ŋolo anyaritae Sadok, ekajion ŋolo atitinyon ka ŋikapolok ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiarei ŋulu anateker keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alokabila a Benjamin, ŋiyeneta a Saul, arae ŋalipyo ŋauni, alalak sek ekiŋaren ikes ŋulu ariito ka ŋituŋa a ekal a Saul akitodol apaki ŋin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alokabila ka Epuraim, ŋikajiok ŋulu atitinyok, ŋulu arwok anatekerin kec, arae ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋamiae ŋakanikauni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito anatutubet a apei a ekabila a Manase ŋulu keponi tonyaraunae alosit akituruwor Daudi erwosit, arae ŋalipyo ŋatomon ka ŋakanikauni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋikilyok ŋulu keponito alokabila a Isakar, ŋulu kepedorito ayenun ŋakiro iteete ŋikacer ŋuna itiyakinosi ka ŋuna emaikina Ŋisirael kitiyata, arae ŋikarikok ŋamiae ŋaarei, arukito ikes kaapei ka ŋiyeneta kec ŋulu arae ikes apolokinito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alokabila a Sebulon, ŋulu ayenete nooi ejie, ŋulu etemokino ajiore a ŋiboro a ŋulujiet a daadaŋ, ido ariito ikes daadaŋ akiŋarakin Daudi bon, arae ŋalipyo ŋatomonikan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alokabila a Naputali arae ŋikarikok aliput ka ŋuluce ŋalipyo ŋatomoniuni ka ŋakanikaarei ŋulu ayakatar ŋaupala ka ŋakwaaras. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alokabila a Dan, ŋulu etemokino aŋuna ke ejie, arae ŋalipyo ŋatomoniare ka ŋakanikauni ka ŋamiae ŋakanikapei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alokabila ka Aser, ŋulu ayenete nooi ejie, ŋulu etemokino aŋuna ke ejie, arae ŋalipyo ŋatomoniomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok ŋulu aponito alo Kide Yorodan, ŋulu alokabila a Ruben ka Gad ta ŋulu ka atutubet a apei a ekabila a Manase ŋulu ayakatar ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulujiet, arae ŋalipyo amiat ka ŋatomoniarei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
