          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikajiok ŋul daadaŋ ŋulu etemokino aŋuna ke ejie, toloto Eburon, acamito ikes jik akituruwor Daudi erwosit anakwap a Isirael a daadaŋ. Emorikina Ŋisirael daadaŋ anacamit a ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikajiok ŋul kiboiyoto ka Daudi alo Eburon ŋirwa ŋiuni, imujete ka emasete akimuj ŋina ainunito ŋituŋa ka akwap kec ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayaunito daŋ neni kec akimuj ŋikidunyetkec ŋulu alo Isakar, Sebulon ka Naputali. Aayeneneo akimuj ŋin neni kec a ŋisigirya, a ŋikaala, a ŋaŋolei-sigirya ka a ŋimoŋin. Alalak ŋamuja ŋun nooi, ido arae ikes nu: Ŋakirya, ŋimugati ŋulu ipounitoe a ŋaboboryo, ŋaboboryo ŋuna erukitoe esibit ŋamugati, epiini, akimyet, ŋimoŋin ka ŋamesekin. Etoodiunito ŋul daadaŋ alelyanu ŋina ayai Isirael daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
